   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0003_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>dʾṭyn' MN ZK Y ʿL
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>bwn' ZNH BYRḤ hwrdṭ
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>Y ŠNṬ ©©-III-III-III hmʾk'
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>Y LʿYN' gwpṭʾl
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>lʾd ywdṭ MN ZK Y
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>YḤBWNṭ' ʾḤRN
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>swpṭk' I
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>dwlk' ṭlynk'
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>W zylk' ʿL
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>ZY-ṭng
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>PWN glmyh
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trl-p1-l12"/>gwhlkdʾn
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trl-p1-l13"/>YḤBWNṭ'
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trl-p1-l14"/>ck' ṭl-[
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trl-p1-l15"/>plʾdy
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP0003_trl-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p2-l1"/>lʾsṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0003_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Dādēn az ān ī ō
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>bun ēn māh Hordād
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>ī sāl 49 hamāg
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>ī pēš guftār
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>rāy ǰud az ān ī
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>dād any
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>suftag 1
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>dōlag tarēnag
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>ud zīrag ō
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>ī-tang
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>pad garmīh
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/>gōhragdān
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trc-p1-l13"/>dād
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trc-p1-l14"/>čak tar-[
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trc-p1-l15"/>Frāy
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP0003_trc-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p2-l1"/>rāst
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0003_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>[1] Dādēn from that which belongs to the [2] bun this month Hordād (3rd month) [3-5] of the year 49 (700/701 ce) on behalf of everything which has been promised earlier except what [6] has (already) been given [7–8] 1 pail of juice, pot-herbs [9] and cumin to [10–12] what is short in the stock of the kitchen [13] is to give. [14–15] Frāy (sealed) the čak.
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP0003_trans-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p2-l1"/>Correct.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
